module vm_intops .
rem RFC-0156 §8-3 · §8-6 (2026-11-08) — 표준 라이브러리 `intops` 의 경계값. 답은 손으로 셈한 것이고 골든이 대조한다. 차등 스윕이 두 뒤끝을 견준다.
use intops .
fn ac8s input a u8 . input b u8 . input c u8 . output u8 . requires le c. 1 . . do return field intops.add_carry_u8 a. b. c. . sum . . end .
fn ac8c input a u8 . input b u8 . input c u8 . output u8 . requires le c. 1 . . do return field intops.add_carry_u8 a. b. c. . carry . . end .
fn ac64c input a u64 . input b u64 . input c u64 . output u64 . requires le c. 1 . . do return field intops.add_carry_u64 a. b. c. . carry . . end .
fn sb8d input a u8 . input b u8 . input c u8 . output u8 . requires le c. 1 . . do return field intops.sub_borrow_u8 a. b. c. . diff . . end .
fn sb8b input a u8 . input b u8 . input c u8 . output u8 . requires le c. 1 . . do return field intops.sub_borrow_u8 a. b. c. . borrow . . end .
fn mw8l input a u8 . input b u8 . output u8 . do return field intops.mul_wide_u8 a. b. . lo . . end .
fn mw8h input a u8 . input b u8 . output u8 . do return field intops.mul_wide_u8 a. b. . hi . . end .
fn mw32h input a u32 . input b u32 . output u32 . do return field intops.mul_wide_u32 a. b. . hi . . end .
fn mw64h input a u64 . input b u64 . output u64 . do return field intops.mul_wide_u64 a. b. . hi . . end .
fn mwzh input a usize . input b usize . output usize . do return field intops.mul_wide_usize a. b. . hi . . end .
fn ms8l input a i8 . input b i8 . output u8 . do return field intops.mul_wide_s_i8 a. b. . lo . . end .
fn ms8h input a i8 . input b i8 . output i8 . do return field intops.mul_wide_s_i8 a. b. . hi . . end .
fn ms64h input a i64 . input b i64 . output i64 . do return field intops.mul_wide_s_i64 a. b. . hi . . end .
fn ms64l input a i64 . input b i64 . output u64 . do return field intops.mul_wide_s_i64 a. b. . lo . . end .
fn lt_iu input a i64 . input b u64 . output bool . do return intops.cmp_lt i64. u64. a. b. . . end .
fn eq_iu input a i64 . input b u64 . output bool . do return intops.cmp_eq i64. u64. a. b. . . end .
fn le_ui input a u64 . input b i64 . output bool . do return intops.cmp_le u64. i64. a. b. . . end .
rem 2026-11-11 (W-20261111-2031 D1 · RFC-0052 D7) — `div_floor` 는 `mod` 의 짝, `mod_trunc` 는 `div` 의 짝. 네 부호 조합과 끝값.
fn dfl input a i64 . input b i64 . output i64 . do return intops.div_floor i64. a. b. . . end .
fn mtr input a i64 . input b i64 . output i64 . do return intops.mod_trunc i64. a. b. . . end .
fn dfl8 input a i8 . input b i8 . output i8 . do return intops.div_floor i8. a. b. . . end .
fn dflu input a u64 . input b u64 . output u64 . do return intops.div_floor u64. a. b. . . end .
fn mtru input a u64 . input b u64 . output u64 . do return intops.mod_trunc u64. a. b. . . end .
fn pairf input a i64 . input b i64 . output i64 . do return add mul intops.div_floor i64. a. b. . b. . mod a. b. . . . end .
fn pairt input a i64 . input b i64 . output i64 . do return add mul div a. b. . b. . intops.mod_trunc i64. a. b. . . . end .
